LinearBuildGraphVizOptions
--------------------

.. note::

  This module is not intended to be included in LinearBuild projects directly.
  It once contained the information for using Graphviz in LinearBuild.  For
  Graphviz usage in LinearBuild refer to the :option:`linearbuild --graphviz`.
